#Primary Weapons
; Give the beam families damaging RTS command bases a shared damage type.
; Their normal damage against ships stays unchanged; RTS Base Hull applies the
; base-only multiplier.
;
; THIS LIST IS MACHINE-AUDITED. core/tools/test_table_references.py diffs it
; against the real retail beam set (extracted from root_fs2.vp; every entry
; with $BeamInfo:, a "beam" $Flags entry, or an @Laser Bitmap), and fails if a
; retail beam is missing or if an entry here names a weapon retail does not
; have. Do not hand-maintain it: a name that retail lacks is skipped by the
; engine, so a wrong entry makes this list look fuller than it is while
; changing nothing. That is how three dead entries survived here, and how
; MjolnirBeam - a 750-damage continuous laser - stayed uncapped.
;
; Why an allowlist at all, when the mod does not own the beam tables: FSO armor
; entries key their multipliers by damage type, so the cap has to be expressed
; as "beams vs base hull". Rather than retyping all of retail, the base armor
; type could carry a catch-all and weapons could opt out; that is not what ships
; today, so the audit test above is what keeps this honest.
$Name: BVas
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: AAAf
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: AAAh
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: SAAA
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: S-AAA-Weak
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: SRed
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: LRed
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: LTerSlash
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: TerSlash
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: VSlash
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: SGreen
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: Green Beam
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: BGreen
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: LRBGreen
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: SVas
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: ULTRA Anti-Fighter Beam
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: @Targeting Laser
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
; The Mjolnir pair. 750 and 400 continuous damage per the retail table, and the
; mod defines MjolnirBeam itself for a sentry beam role, so it was a mod-owned
; weapon silently hitting command stations at full damage.
$Name: MjolnirBeam
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: MjolnirBeam#home
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
; The retail Beam-Fire family. BFRed was absent here and bypassed the base cap
; entirely: a Shivan station turret did ~411 hull damage per uncapped hit and
; solo-killed a 132,600 HP command station in four of eight headless matches.
; BFBlue, BFBas and BFTerr were also listed as insurance against the same
; family, but retail has no such weapons, so the engine discarded all three
; entries and the list only appeared more thorough than it was. Only the names
; retail actually defines are here now.
$Name: BFRed
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
$Name: BFGreen
+nocreate
$Damage Type: RTS Capital Beam
#End